<section class="help-page" data-help-page>
  <div class="help-home" data-help-home>
    <div class="help-titlebar">
      <h1>Help Center</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="help-hero">
      <h2>Hi, how can I help you?</h2>
      <label class="help-search" data-help-search>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M16.5 16.5 21 21" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <input type="search" placeholder="Search" autocomplete="off">
      </label>
    </div>

    <div class="help-articles">
      <h3>FAQs</h3>
      <div class="help-faq">
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>What is your cancellation policy?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>Orders can be canceled within 2 hours.</p>
            <p>Please email our team at <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com">support@curvdlondon.com</a> with your cancellation request as soon as possible.</p>
            <p>You will receive confirmation of your cancellation if we’re able to make it happen.</p>
            <p>After this period, we may not be able to cancel your order as it might already be in processing or shipment.</p>
            <p>If you have already received an order confirmation email, it may be impossible to cancel your order. However, you can always request a return or exchange once your order arrives.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>How do I cancel my order?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>You will have the option to cancel your order within your confirmation email. You may also contact our customer service team at <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com">support@curvdlondon.com</a>. Please include your order number and the reason for cancellation in your message.</p>
            <p>Orders can only be canceled before they have been dispatched. If your order has already been shipped, please refer to our return policy for further instructions.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>What do I do if my item(s) arrives damaged?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>We’re sorry your item(s) have damage!</p>
            <p>Some items break during shipment. We’ll do our best to help.</p>
            <p>Please email our team at <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com">support@curvdlondon.com</a> with an image of your damaged item for further assistance.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>My order was marked delivered but it’s not here.</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>If no one was home at the time of delivery, the carrier will leave the package in a safe location.</p>
            <p>Be sure to check around your home and with neighbors/building management who may have collected the package for you.</p>
            <p>Also, please double-check the shipping address of your order (in the order confirmation email) to ensure it’s headed to the right location.</p>
            <p>On some occasions, packages may be marked as delivered too early in cases of a delivery glitch with the carrier, but take additional time to arrive.</p>
            <p>If you are still unable to locate the package, please reach out to the carrier directly with your order number and delivery details.</p>
            <p>If you need additional assistance, please email our team at <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com">support@curvdlondon.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>Do you offer free shipping?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>We offer fast and free shipping for orders over $50.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>How long does delivery take?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>Orders are shipped from our partner warehouses in Hong Kong, Europe, and the U.S. via trusted carriers such as FedEx, USPS, DHL, and DPD.</p>
            <p>If stock is unavailable in your closest warehouse, we may ship from another location — shipping times below account for this.</p>
            <p><strong>Order processing:</strong> 1–3 business days before dispatch. Orders placed on weekends or public holidays will be processed on the next working day.</p>
            <p>Delivery times vary by destination and may be affected by customs clearance delays:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>United States: 5–10 business days</li>
              <li>United Kingdom: 5–10 business days</li>
              <li>Canada &amp; Europe: 6–10 business days</li>
              <li>Australia &amp; New Zealand: 12–14 business days</li>
              <li>Central &amp; South America, Asia, Africa: 8–14 business days</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>How do I track my order?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>Once your order has been placed and processed, you will receive a confirmation email with your order details. This email will include a tracking number and a link to our tracking page.</p>
            <p><a href="/collections/order-tracking">Track your order here</a>.</p>
            <p>Tracking information may not be immediately available after your order is placed. It can take up to 24 hours for the number to become active in our system. If you don't see any updates right away, please be patient and check back later.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>Do you offer refunds or exchanges?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>Yes. We offer a free size exchange within 30 days of delivery, and refunds to your original payment method within 14 days of delivery.</p>
            <p>From day 15 to day 30, we can offer store credit or an exchange.</p>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com">support@curvdlondon.com</a> with your order number to get started.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>What do I do if I receive the wrong item in my order?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>We are sorry to hear you received the wrong item in your order! Please report your order issue to our team via email for further assistance.</p>
            <p>Include a photo of the item received and the name of the missing item(s). Please double-check the package for any notes or packing slips that indicate your other item(s) were shipped separately.</p>
            <p>While we may not be able to guarantee your exact order is replaced due to potential stock issues, we’ll resolve the situation as best we can.</p>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com">support@curvdlondon.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details data-help-item>
          <summary>What’s your return policy?</summary>
          <div class="acc-body">
            <p>We’re happy to accept returns on online orders requested within 30 days of delivery.</p>
            <p>To start a return, email <a href="mailto:support@curvdlondon.com">support@curvdlondon.com</a> with your order number.</p>
            <p>Free size exchange is available within 30 days. Refunds to your card are available within 14 days of delivery if the item is returned in its original condition.</p>
            <p><a href="/policies/refund-policy">Read the full Returns &amp; Refund Policy</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>

      <div class="help-support">
        <h3>Get support</h3>
        <a class="help-contact-card" href="#contact" data-open-help-contact>
          <span class="help-contact-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7"/><path d="M4 7l8 6 8-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </span>
          <span>Contact us</span>
          <span class="help-contact-card__chev">›</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="help-contact-view" data-help-contact hidden>
    <div class="help-bc">
      <a href="/pages/help-center" data-help-home-link aria-label="Back">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 5 8 12l7 7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
      <span class="help-bc__chev">Help Center</span>
    </div>
    {% form 'contact', class: 'help-ticket' %}
      <h2>Send us a message</h2>
      {% if form.posted_successfully? %}
        <p class="notice">Thanks — we received your message and will get back to you soon.</p>
      {% endif %}
      {{ form.errors | default_errors }}
      <label class="help-field">
        <span>Name</span>
        <input type="text" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name">
      </label>
      <label class="help-field">
        <span>Email <i>*</i></span>
        <input type="email" name="contact[email]" required autocomplete="email">
      </label>
      <label class="help-field">
        <span>Subject</span>
        <input type="text" name="contact[subject]" autocomplete="off">
      </label>
      <label class="help-field">
        <span>Message <i>*</i></span>
        <textarea name="contact[body]" required></textarea>
      </label>
      <p class="help-attach-note">If you have photos of a damaged or incorrect item, mention that in your message and attach them in your reply to our team.</p>
      <button class="help-send" type="submit">Send</button>
      <p class="help-recaptcha">This form is protected. By sending, you agree to be contacted about your request.</p>
    {% endform %}
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{ "name": "Help center", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
